Bespin Qt widget style - Qt6 port

Quick start (Qt6)
=================
Requirements: CMake >= 3.16, a C++17 compiler, Qt6 (Core, Gui, Widgets)

    cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build
    sudo cmake --install build          # installs libbespin.so into Qt6's plugins/styles
    ./install_presets.sh presets         # optional: import the bundled presets

Then run any Qt6 application with  -style bespin  (or QT_STYLE_OVERRIDE=bespin),
or select "Bespin" in your desktop's application style settings.
"bespin" (the config tool, from config/) configures the style.
